      "record_index": 609,
      "record_sha256": "0eda0b9cc75fefa901f55f8e4165a6047c80fbcc38f6dc0f72e01d958917ffff",
      "text": "{\n  \"op\": \"write_workspace\",\n  \"name\": \"notes.md\",\n  \"text\": \"Elara, a young adventurer, discovers a mysterious map leading her to either the Whispering Woods or an ancient cave. She chooses to explore the Whispering Woods, where she\u9047\u89c1s a Friendly Squirrel named Whiskers. Whiskers guides her to a Puzzle Tree with locks that\u9700\u8981 be unlocked by arranging leaves in the correct order based on their colors: green\uff08morning\uff09\uff0cyellow\uff08afternoon\uff09\uff0cand red\uff08evening\uff09.\"\n}"
    },
    {
      "actor": "child",
      "commit_record_index": 613,
      "commit_record_sha256": "04ee4cae0467830dee5a730c130c0f5a1c090e32e58379dd137c3a9be81afd7a",
      "record_index": 612,
      "record_sha256": "c3bb1afe65fa58af44b1cddeecfdee48c2e03acc22fcddd93fd55187a0d0be24",
      "text": "{\n  \"op\": \"sleep\"\n}\n\n---\n\nDuring her adventure, Elara finds herself in the heart of the Whispering Woods, following the.map she discovered in an ancient Cave. The map leads her through a series of marked Trees, but she realizes she has taken a wrong turn. Now, she must rely on th\ne map and her wits to find her way back. Suddenly, she encounters a Friendly Squirrel named Whiskers who offers to guide her. Whiskers leads her to a Puzzle Tree with locks that need to be unlocked by arranging leaves based on their colors: green (morning), yellow (afternoon),\u548c\u7ea2\u8272\uff08\u665a\u4e0a\uff09\u3002\n\nElara carefully unwinds the map in the dim light of her lantern. The inscription reads: \"Beyond the Whispering Woods, seek the Stone of Silence.\" She now faces a choice:\n1. Head to the Whispering Woods\n2. Try to decipher more o\nf the inscription\n\nWhat would you like Elara to do next?"
    },
